<title>HONG KONG: Emperor (China) posts deeper H1 net loss.</title>
<headline>Emperor (China) posts deeper H1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  9.08 loss  vs 3.00 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 6.96 loss  vs 1.03 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   30.09 loss vs 9.11 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    311.29     vs 423.69</p>
<p>    Company name		Emperor (China Concept) Investments</p>
<p>				    Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
